The Silhouette Sofa series by GamFratesi is characterised by the smooth curve of the sofa’s back, which seamlessly combines a strong character with a simple, organic expression. With an angular front view and defining piping details, the sofa appears compact and economical with space, yet is light and spacious and offers generous seating. The family comprises sofas in different sizes and heights, with legs available in metal or solid wood and a number of selected textiles to choose from. The different configurations and strong structural language make the sofa a natural choice for defining space and creating intimacy in large and small areas in private and public contexts.